{"id": "ru-24c841f968e3.de", "jokeId": "ru-24c841f968e3", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Vovochka becomes Fritzchen, dollars become euros; every 'Ich weiß alles!' step kept, Mama leaves before Papa comes so his 'Zu Mama kein Wort!' makes sense, the postman drops his letter as the bag.", "title": "Ich weiß alles!", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["vovochka", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"vovochka": "fritzchen", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "father"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Fritzchens Freunde haben ihm erzählt, dass alle Erwachsenen ein Geheimnis haben und man sie deshalb ganz leicht erpressen kann.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Fritzchen will das prüfen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Ich weiß alles!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Mama wird blass und steckt Fritzchen zwanzig Euro zu.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Nur sag es nicht Papa!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Das gefällt Fritzchen sehr. Dann kommt Papa von der Arbeit.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Ich weiß alles!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Papa schaut sich nervös um und gibt Fritzchen fünfzig Euro.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Zu Mama kein Wort!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am Morgen trifft Fritzchen den Briefträger am Gartentor.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Ich weiß alles!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Briefträger lässt seine Tasche fallen, eine Träne glänzt auf seiner Wange, und mit offenen Armen ruft er:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Dann komm doch her und umarme deinen Papa, mein Sohn!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["vovochka", "zhena", "muzhik"], "roles": {"vovochka": "fritzchen", "zhena": "mother", "muzhik": "father"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "vovochka"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["vovochka", "paren"], "roles": {"vovochka": "fritzchen", "paren": "postman"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "letter", "action": "drop"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-d907b2636126.ru", "jokeId": "ru-d907b2636126", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "The reported question became the reporter's own line; 'улыбается и говорит' is shown by the smug face.", "title": "Тест на выписку", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "journalist", "doktor": "doctor"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Корреспондент спрашивает директора дурдома:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Какой тест является критерием для выписки?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Мы наливаем полную ванну воды, кладём рядом чайную ложечку и большую кружку, и предлагаем освободить ванну от воды.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ну, любой нормальный человек возьмёт кружку.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Нет, нормальный человек вынет пробку.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-d907b2636126.en", "jokeId": "ru-d907b2636126", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the reported question became the reporter's line.", "title": "The Discharge Test", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "journalist", "doktor": "doctor"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A reporter asks the director of a mental asylum:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "paren", "text": "What test do you use to decide whether a patient can be discharged?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "We fill a bathtub with water, put a teaspoon and a big mug next to it, and ask them to empty the tub.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Well, any normal person would take the mug.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "No. A normal person would pull the plug.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-d907b2636126.de", "jokeId": "ru-d907b2636126", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the reported question became the reporter's line.", "title": "Der Entlassungstest", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["paren", "doktor"], "roles": {"paren": "journalist", "doktor": "doctor"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Reporter fragt den Direktor einer Irrenanstalt:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Welcher Test entscheidet bei Ihnen über die Entlassung?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Wir füllen eine Badewanne mit Wasser, legen einen Teelöffel und einen großen Becher daneben und bitten, die Wanne zu leeren.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Na, jeder normale Mensch nimmt den Becher.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Nein. Ein normaler Mensch zieht den Stöpsel.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-d5429b6d16fb.ru", "jokeId": "ru-d5429b6d16fb", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "All dialogue kept as written; speech tags dropped, the nun walks in and the man walks to the counter on screen.", "title": "Сестра Анна", "location": "bar", "cast": ["uchilka", "muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"uchilka": "nun", "muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "bartender"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Сидит мужик в кафе. Квасит. Мимо проходит монашка.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Как ты можешь прожигать свою жизнь в этом пристанище блуда и разврата!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Да нет тут никакого разврата, сестра...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Анна.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Да, Анна. Всё нормально. Я просто пью.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "И это противно Господу.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ты сама-то, сестра Анна, пробовала хоть раз?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Нет!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Как же ты можешь утверждать? Вот, я сейчас куплю тебе выпивку, и ты попробуешь...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Никогда! Чтобы люди увидели, как монашка пьёт спиртное?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я попрошу, чтобы тебе налили в чашку.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Монашка неохотно соглашается. Мужик подходит к стойке.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Слышь, дай мне два стакана водки, но один налей в чайную чашку.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Что, опять сестра Анна?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["uchilka", "muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"uchilka": "nun", "muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "bartender"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "right"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "uchilka", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-d5429b6d16fb.en", "jokeId": "ru-d5429b6d16fb", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, vodka kept; the nun walks in and the man walks to the bar on screen.", "title": "Sister Anna", "location": "bar", "cast": ["uchilka", "muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"uchilka": "nun", "muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "bartender"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A man sits in a café, getting drunk. A nun walks past.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "How can you waste your life in this den of lust and debauchery!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "There's no debauchery here, Sister...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Anna.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Yes, Anna. It's all fine. I'm just drinking.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "And that is hateful to the Lord.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Have you ever tried it yourself, Sister Anna?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "No!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Then how can you say that? Here, I'll buy you a drink, and you'll try it...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Never! So people can see a nun drinking alcohol?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I'll ask them to pour yours into a cup.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The nun reluctantly agrees. The man goes up to the bar.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hey, give me two glasses of vodka, but pour one into a teacup.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "What, Sister Anna again?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["uchilka", "muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"uchilka": "nun", "muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "bartender"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "right"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "uchilka", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-d5429b6d16fb.de", "jokeId": "ru-d5429b6d16fb", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, Wodka kept; the nun walks in and the man walks to the counter on screen.", "title": "Schwester Anna", "location": "bar", "cast": ["uchilka", "muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"uchilka": "nun", "muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "bartender"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Mann sitzt im Café und betrinkt sich. Eine Nonne geht vorbei.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Wie kannst du dein Leben in dieser Höhle der Unzucht und Verderbtheit verschwenden!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hier gibt es doch keine Verderbtheit, Schwester...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Anna.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ja, Anna. Alles in Ordnung. Ich trinke nur.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Und das ist dem Herrn zuwider.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hast du es selbst schon mal probiert, Schwester Anna?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Nein!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Wie kannst du es dann behaupten? Komm, ich kaufe dir was zu trinken, und du probierst...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Niemals! Damit die Leute sehen, wie eine Nonne Schnaps trinkt?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ich lasse es dir in eine Tasse gießen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Die Nonne willigt widerwillig ein. Der Mann geht zur Theke.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hör mal, gib mir zwei Gläser Wodka, aber gieß eins in eine Teetasse.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Was, schon wieder Schwester Anna?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["uchilka", "muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"uchilka": "nun", "muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "bartender"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "right"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "uchilka", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9144c5573f9c.ru", "jokeId": "ru-9144c5573f9c", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Monologue kept word for word, split into four lines; the doctor's reported 'как дела' became his line; the street meeting is a second scene, the neighbour stays only in the story.", "title": "Ножки кровати", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Доктор, я совсем замучился. Ложусь спать, а мне кажется, что под кроватью кто-то есть.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Лезу под кровать, смотрю внимательно, и тут чую, что кто-то на моей кровати лежит.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вылезаю из-под кровати, наверху никого нет, ложусь, чувствую — всё-таки кто-то есть под кроватью.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "А когда снова лезу под кровать, мне кажется, что сверху кто-то есть. И так всю ночь.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Да, это есть такой сложный синдром. Будем вас интенсивно лечить, месяца два-три.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Берём мы, правда, дорого, но, скорей всего, вылечим.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ладно, подумаю.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "И больше не пришёл. Через месяц врач случайно встречает его на улице.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Как дела?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "А меня сосед за бутылку вылечил.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Это как?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Да выпили мы с ним, он мне и говорит: отпили ты на фиг ножки у кровати.", "uncensored": "Да выпили мы с ним, он мне и говорит: отпили ты на хрен ножки у кровати.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-left"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9144c5573f9c.en", "jokeId": "ru-9144c5573f9c", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'на хрен' becomes 'damn', so no uncensored variant is needed.", "title": "The Bed Legs", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Doctor, I'm worn out. I go to bed, and it feels like someone's under the bed.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I crawl under the bed, take a good look, and then I sense someone lying on my bed.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I crawl out, there's nobody up there, I lie down, and I feel it: someone is under the bed after all.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "And when I crawl under again, it feels like someone's up top. And so on all night.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Yes, that's a complicated syndrome. We'll treat you intensively, for two or three months.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "We do charge a lot, but we'll most likely cure you.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "All right, I'll think about it.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He never came back. A month later the doctor runs into him on the street.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "How are you doing?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "My neighbour cured me for a bottle.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "How so?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "We had a drink, and he tells me: just saw the damn legs off your bed.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-left"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9144c5573f9c.de", "jokeId": "ru-9144c5573f9c", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'на хрен' becomes 'verdammt', so no uncensored variant is needed.", "title": "Die Bettbeine", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Herr Doktor, ich bin völlig fertig. Ich lege mich schlafen, und mir kommt vor, unter dem Bett ist jemand.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ich krieche unters Bett, schaue genau hin, und da spüre ich, dass jemand auf meinem Bett liegt.", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ich krieche raus, oben ist niemand, ich lege mich hin und spüre: Unter dem Bett ist doch jemand.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Und wenn ich wieder unters Bett krieche, kommt mir vor, oben ist jemand. Und so die ganze Nacht.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ja, das ist ein komplexes Syndrom. Wir werden Sie intensiv behandeln, zwei, drei Monate lang.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Wir sind zwar teuer, aber höchstwahrscheinlich heilen wir Sie.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Gut, ich überlege es mir.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er kam nie wieder. Einen Monat später trifft der Arzt ihn zufällig auf der Straße.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Wie geht es Ihnen?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Mich hat der Nachbar für eine Flasche geheilt.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Wie das?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Wir haben einen getrunken, und er sagt zu mir: Säg doch die verdammten Bettbeine ab.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "patient", "doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-left"}]}, {"location": "ulitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3b6c21f6ce35.ru", "jokeId": "ru-3b6c21f6ce35", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "The cop's reported order became his line; seventeen drunks are a crowd behind the driver and the accordion player, both with red noses at night and sober in the morning.", "title": "Баянист", "location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ночью гаишник останавливает горбатый запорожец. Глянул, а там семнадцать пьяных в дрова мужиков.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Тот настолько обалдел, что и штрафовать не стал.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Только чтоб завтра в том же составе ко мне трезвыми явились!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Наутро начинают утрамбовываться в машину. Шестнадцать влезли, а семнадцатый, хоть убей, никак.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Слушай, а может быть, тебя с нами не было?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Здрасте! А кто ж вам вчера на баяне играл?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}, "muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "roadside"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "murmur"}]}, {"location": "doroga", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3b6c21f6ce35.en", "jokeId": "ru-3b6c21f6ce35", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Zaporozhets becomes a tiny old Beetle per the note; the cop's reported order became his line; drunks shown with red noses at night, sober in the morning.", "title": "The Accordion Player", "location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "At night a traffic cop pulls over a tiny old Beetle. He looks inside, and there are seventeen men, dead drunk.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He's so stunned he doesn't even fine them.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Just make sure you all show up here tomorrow, same crew, and sober!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Next morning they start cramming into the car. Sixteen fit in, but the seventeenth just won't, no matter what.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Listen, maybe you weren't with us?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Well, hello! Then who was playing the accordion for you last night?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}, "muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "roadside"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "murmur"}]}, {"location": "doroga", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3b6c21f6ce35.de", "jokeId": "ru-3b6c21f6ce35", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Zaporozhets becomes a Trabi per the note; the cop's reported order became his line; drunks shown with red noses at night, sober in the morning.", "title": "Der Akkordeonspieler", "location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Nachts hält ein Polizist einen Trabi an. Er schaut rein, und da sitzen siebzehn sturzbetrunkene Männer.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er ist so baff, dass er nicht mal einen Strafzettel schreibt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Aber morgen meldet ihr euch bei mir, in derselben Besetzung und nüchtern!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am Morgen quetschen sie sich in den Wagen. Sechzehn passen rein, aber der Siebzehnte, keine Chance.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Hör mal, vielleicht warst du gar nicht dabei?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Na hallo! Und wer hat euch gestern auf dem Akkordeon gespielt?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "traffic-cop", "muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}, "muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "roadside"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "murmur"}]}, {"location": "doroga", "transition": "wipe", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-ryzhy": "driver"}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-b6956f74350f.ru", "jokeId": "ru-b6956f74350f", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue kept as written; 'Не пизди' softened to the same-rhythm 'Не звезди', original in uncensored. Two women from the devushka family, the bragging one with earrings.", "title": "Школа манер", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["devushka", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"devushka": "woman", "devushka-blondinka": "woman"}, "looks": {"devushka-blondinka": {"add": ["earrings"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka", "text": "Как дела?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Замечательно! Ты знаешь, любовник обещал купить мне норковую шубу...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Потрясающе!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "...а ещё он обещал мне купить «Ягуар»...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Потрясающе!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "...а ещё мы с ним поедем отдыхать на Канарские острова!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Потрясающе!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "А что у тебя нового?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Я учусь в школе хороших манер.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "И чему же там учат?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Ну вот, например, на последнем занятии нас учили вместо «Не звезди!» говорить «Потрясающе!»", "uncensored": "Ну вот, например, на последнем занятии нас учили вместо «Не пизди!» говорить «Потрясающе!»", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-b6956f74350f.en", "jokeId": "ru-b6956f74350f", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'Не пизди' is 'Bullshit', softened to 'Bullcrap' in the clean text; 'Fantastic!' stays the last word.", "title": "Charm School", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["devushka", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"devushka": "woman", "devushka-blondinka": "woman"}, "looks": {"devushka-blondinka": {"add": ["earrings"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka", "text": "How are you?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Wonderful! You know, my lover promised to buy me a mink coat...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Fantastic!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "...and he also promised to buy me a Jaguar...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Fantastic!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "...and we're going on holiday to the Canary Islands together!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Fantastic!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "And what's new with you?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "I'm studying at a school of good manners.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "And what do they teach you there?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Well, for example, in the last class they taught us to say, instead of “Bullcrap!”, “Fantastic!”", "uncensored": "Well, for example, in the last class they taught us to say, instead of “Bullshit!”, “Fantastic!”", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-b6956f74350f.de", "jokeId": "ru-b6956f74350f", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'Не пизди' is 'Erzähl keinen Scheiß', softened to 'Mist' in the clean text; 'Fantastisch!' stays the last word.", "title": "Die Benimmschule", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["devushka", "devushka-blondinka"], "roles": {"devushka": "woman", "devushka-blondinka": "woman"}, "looks": {"devushka-blondinka": {"add": ["earrings"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka", "text": "Wie geht's?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Wunderbar! Weißt du, mein Liebhaber hat versprochen, mir einen Nerzmantel zu kaufen...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Fantastisch!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "...und er hat versprochen, mir einen Jaguar zu kaufen...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Fantastisch!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "...und wir fahren zusammen in den Urlaub auf die Kanaren!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Fantastisch!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Und was gibt's bei dir Neues?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Ich gehe auf eine Benimmschule.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-blondinka", "text": "Und was lernt man da?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Na, zum Beispiel haben sie uns in der letzten Stunde beigebracht, statt „Erzähl keinen Mist!“ zu sagen: „Fantastisch!“", "uncensored": "Na, zum Beispiel haben sie uns in der letzten Stunde beigebracht, statt „Erzähl keinen Scheiß!“ zu sagen: „Fantastisch!“", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-de110f53c857.ru", "jokeId": "ru-de110f53c857", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Phone call cross-cut kitchen / mother's living room / kitchen; the husband is not shown so the body stays a surprise.", "title": "Первая ссора", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Три недели после свадьбы. Молодая жена звонит матери вся в слезах.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-ryzhaya", "text": "Мам, я просто не знаю, что делать! У нас тут такая семейная сцена разыгралась! Ужас!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Спокойно, дочка, не расстраивайся. В каждой семье когда-нибудь возникают первые споры, конфликты.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka-ryzhaya", "text": "Да это я знаю. А с трупом чего делать?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-ryzhaya", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["zhena"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "kukhnya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-ryzhaya", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-de110f53c857.en", "jokeId": "ru-de110f53c857", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; phone call cross-cut, the husband stays unseen until the punchline.", "title": "The First Fight", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Three weeks after the wedding. A young wife calls her mother in tears.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-ryzhaya", "text": "Mom, I just don't know what to do! We've had such a family scene here! It's awful!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Calm down, sweetie, don't get upset. Every family has its first arguments and fights sooner or later.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka-ryzhaya", "text": "Yeah, I know that. But what do I do with the body?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-ryzhaya", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["zhena"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "kukhnya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-ryzhaya", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-de110f53c857.de", "jokeId": "ru-de110f53c857", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; phone call cross-cut, the husband stays unseen until the punchline.", "title": "Der erste Streit", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Drei Wochen nach der Hochzeit. Die junge Ehefrau ruft weinend ihre Mutter an.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka-ryzhaya", "text": "Mama, ich weiß einfach nicht, was ich tun soll! Bei uns gab es so eine Familienszene! Schrecklich!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ruhig, Kind, reg dich nicht auf. In jeder Familie gibt es irgendwann den ersten Streit, die ersten Konflikte.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka-ryzhaya", "text": "Ja, das weiß ich. Aber was mache ich mit der Leiche?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-ryzhaya", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["zhena"], "roles": {"zhena": "mother"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}, {"location": "kukhnya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["devushka-ryzhaya"], "roles": {"devushka-ryzhaya": "daughter"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "devushka-ryzhaya", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-2c8ec8a88248.ru", "jokeId": "ru-2c8ec8a88248", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue kept as written, numbers as words; the husband exists only in the wife's story.", "title": "Блёсны", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["devushka", "zhena"], "roles": {"devushka": "woman", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "devushka", "text": "Ты чего такая взвинченная? Что случилось?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Подарила мужу на двадцать третье февраля набор рыболовных блёсен.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Ну, всё правильно. Он у тебя уже десять лет каждые выходные на рыбалку уезжает. Чего не так?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Он его в руках вертел, вертел и спрашивает: а что это такое?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
